title: MySQL LOAD_FILE Local File Read
id: 053055fe-5e2a-4b07-8e54-e460678d304b
status: experimental
description: Detects use of the MySQL LOAD_FILE() function to read local files (/etc/passwd, config files) through the database, a data-access technique often chained from SQL injection.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1005/
logsource:
  category: application
  product: mysql
detection:
  selection:
    query_text|contains: 'LOAD_FILE('
    query_text|contains:
      - '/etc/'
      - '/var/'
      - '.conf'
      - '.pem'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - query_text
  - user_name
  - client_ip
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate file import
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.collection
  - attack.t1005
